    <briefdescription>
<para>Black volatility surface modelled as variance surface. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class calculates time/strike dependent Black volatilities using as input a matrix of Black volatilities observed in the market.</para><para>The calculation is performed interpolating on the variance surface. <ref refid="bilinear" kindref="compound">Bilinear</ref> interpolation is used as default; this can be changed by the setInterpolation() method.</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000062"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>check time extrapolation</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
